{#
  Site-wide line-icon set (Tabler geometry, 24x24, 1.75 stroke, currentColor).

  One source for every icon slot on the site. Emoji drift across pages -- the front
  page shipped custom SVGs while /features, /demo, /scorecard and /sms-consent still
  used emoji -- so the whole set lives here now. Add an icon by adding a key.

  Usage:
    {% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
    <div class="industry-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("scissors") }}</div>

  The wrapper element carries aria-hidden, not the <svg> -- keep it that way so the
  markup matches what the front page already ships.
#}
